          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "дешеветь (deshevét) is built on дешёвый \"cheap\": to become cheap. Дешёвый goes back to Old Russian deševŭ, which is usually derived from десить \"to find, to come upon\": what is cheap is easily come by."
